  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9c0afcf-8c61-497f-a1a4-33ad22396f32\" alt=\"LOGO_4\"></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@tapeqz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/28-FF0000?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white&label=YouTube\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/wX836fj6pz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/JOIN-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ftapeQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/PROFILE-1bd96a?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=Modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tapeq/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/PROJECTS-F16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=CurseForge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/tapeQz/Shine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Shine-181717?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white&label=GitHub\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n</span></em></p>\n<h1>它有什么功能？</h1>\n<p>目前，该模组添加了以下功能，<strong>无需光影</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择性泛光</li>\n<li>彩色光源</li>\n<li>轮廓光（方块边缘光效）</li>\n<li>自定义禁用阴影（卡通风格）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>开启后<strong>几乎不损失性能</strong>，并支持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>高度可定制</strong>且<strong>易于使用</strong>的配置界面。你可以将几乎所有内容更改为你喜欢的设置。</p>\n<p><strong>无外部依赖</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>不兼容的模组</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Nvidium</li>\n<li>Immersive Portals</li>\n<li>VulkanMod</li>\n<li>Sodium 核心光影支持</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>版权所有 © 2026 tapeQ</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>你可以将此模组包含在整合包中</strong>，只要整合包提供署名并链接到 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 页面即可。</li>\n</ul>",
